				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-28f66066 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="28f66066" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3e7e62a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3e7e62a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why K-beauty salons <span class="hl">sell routines, not treatments</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7298ac6e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7298ac6e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62d3684b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="62d3684b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1fa803df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1fa803df" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A Korean beauty salon&#8217;s real product is a maintained routine — glass skin, BB Glow, scalp health — not a single service. Marketing it as a menu of individual treatments, the way a generic beauty salon does, ignores the actual retention model this category depends on.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7070b7ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7070b7ba" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Trends move fast, and being first matters</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f9cecfb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1f9cecfb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>K-beauty techniques and product ingredients trend and shift quickly on TikTok — a salon whose content lags six months behind current trends looks outdated to an audience that follows this space closely, even if the actual treatment quality hasn&#8217;t changed.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c7deaeb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1c7deaeb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Retail products are part of the service, not a separate upsell</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-77af0d66 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="77af0d66" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Clients expect to buy the exact serums and masks used in their treatment to continue the routine at home — this makes ecommerce genuinely core to the business model here, not a nice-to-have add-on the way it is for most other salon types.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-45541b94 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="45541b94" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53799978 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="53799978" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">K-beauty salons, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3-4 wks</b><span>— typical glass-skin facial maintenance cycle</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 350-2,200</b><span>— real Dubai price range across services</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">TikTok-led</b><span>— primary discovery channel for trends</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">High attach</b><span>— retail product sales tied to in-treatment routine</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
