														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do you handle series-based bookings like BB Glow?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1223" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1223"><p>Yes — BB Glow and similar services are typically sold as a series of sessions, and we build pre-booking education content and automated reminders to prevent drop-off after the first session.</p></div>
				</div>
